From: cwriter <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/31379>
Subject: [PATCH] sycl : fuse GDN with GET_ROWS to remove temporary copy (PR 31379, draft)

PR commit 7f72c2a5 (draft), re-anchored on top of the full stack and C10..C62:
- ggml_sycl_is_view_or_noop() moves to common.hpp as in the PR; the copy that
  stays in ggml-sycl.cpp next to local 0015's SSM_SCAN cache matcher is dropped.
- The GDN gather flag, its env read and log line, the graph-compute hooks and
  the allocator dependencies sit next to carried PR 31355's conv-window ones.
- graph_optimize and the whole-graph perf mode in test-backend-ops come from
  PR 31355 already (same author, identical lines), so they are not repeated.

The gated delta net reads its recurrent state rows straight from the cache
through the GET_ROWS ids instead of from a gathered copy. Qwen3.5 / Qwen3-Next
token generation. Off switch: GGML_SYCL_GDN_STATE_GATHER=0.

